WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.086 --> 00:00:00.904
BENEDICT CUMBERBATCH
Hey, everyone!

00:00:00.955 --> 00:00:04.238
We are the cast of Doctor Strange
in the Multiverse of Madness.

00:00:04.289 --> 00:00:05.944
ELIZABETH OLSEN
We're all really proud of this film,

00:00:05.995 --> 00:00:07.714
and so appreciative of your support.

